# KeePassXC: notifications, tray, its own names (single instance, the browser integration's
# org.keepassxc.KeePassXC.MainWindow). The Secret Service (org.freedesktop.secrets) only while it is
# turned on in KeePassXC's own settings (FdoSecrets). No portal file chooser: it saves a database
# by writing a temporary file and a backup next to it. Screen-lock detection: labwc has no
# org.freedesktop.ScreenSaver or org.gnome.ScreenSaver and logind is on the system bus (blocked), so
# KeePassXC's idle timeout and lock-on-minimise are what lock it.
include notify
include tray
own org.keepassxc.KeePassXC.*
own-if keepassxc-secret-service org.freedesktop.secrets
